============================================================================================
  The search recovers more often than budget-matched restarts (3/8 vs 0/8), so it is contributing
  something beyond re-drawing weights.
  restart-*-true is the ceiling for restarts once operator choice is
  free; the gap between it and plain restart is what operator
  selection would be worth if it were solved perfectly.
